# Remotion bundles with webpack and resolves three / react / react-dom as peers
# across @remotion/three and @react-three/fiber; pnpm's strict layout hides
# them from each other unless they are hoisted. Measured: without this the
# bundle builds but the ThreeCanvas cannot find its peer copies of three.
public-hoist-pattern[]=*three*
public-hoist-pattern[]=react
public-hoist-pattern[]=react-dom
